n't like the feeling when the batteries die, as if you've lost part of your brain.","target":"You come to rely on gadgets and digital numbers like grease on lips and milk on cereal, and I don't like the feeling when the batteries die, as if you've lost part of your brain.","line":11}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
